# PLANETBINTANG DOMAIN SEARCH SYSTEM (.NZ)
# Role: canonical runtime specification for the global CARI page.
# UI: ../index.html section #searchPage; layout: ../search-page.css; runtime: ../search-page.js
# Primary local source: ../data/domain-registry.nz (JSON Lines, one domain record per line).
# Shared domain catalog: https://github.com/planetbintang/al.l/tree/io/data.media
# Published shard: data.media/domain-000001.jsonl (JSONL records: domain, status, sumber, shard, urutan).
# Catalog manifest: data.media/manifest.json; seed list: data.media/domain-seeds.txt.
# Browser loader reads the local registry and the published AL.L shard; it does not crawl 500,000 virtual target shards.
# Search modes: all (domain + web references), domain (registry only), web (Wikipedia search API).
# Results render inside #safariResultsList; submitting a query must not redirect the page to another search provider.
# A user may open a result link explicitly; that is separate from submitting a search.
# Status values are catalog metadata only; never present them as DNS, registration, uptime, or reachability verification.
# Unknown domains may be shown as unlisted input candidates, not as registered or active domains.
# Record format: {"domain":"example.tld","status":"source/status"}
# Keep this specification synchronized with search-page.js and data/domain-registry.nz.
